OL,3,CNI roadworks company fined E1.2m after
OL,4,Cfather and two children died in lough
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland - based firm
OL,7,FWhitemountain Quarries has been fined
OL,8,Fmore than one million pounds for road
OL,9,Fmanagement failures which claimed the
OL,10,Flives of three members of the one
OL,11,Ffamily in County Donegal six years ago.
OL,13,FSpeaking after the case ended, the
OL,14,Fsole survivor of the tragedy Geraldine
OL,15,FMullan said "the pain and grief of
OL,16,Flosing her husband, son and daughter
OL,17,Fwill never leave her."
OL,26,@kD@\Ok
