OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785525522
OL,3,CNI roadworks company fined E1.2m after
OL,4,Cfather and two children died in lough
OL,6,FForty-nine-year-old John Mullan and
OL,7,Fhis children, Tomas, 14, and Amelia,
OL,8,F6, died when their car slid down an
OL,9,Fembankment at roadworks and into Lough
OL,10,FFoyle.
OL,12,FThe sole survivor, Geraldine Mullan,
OL,13,Fhad managed to get out of the upturned
OL,14,Fvehicle as the stormy waters claimed
OL,15,Fthe lives of her husband, son and
OL,16,Fdaughter.
OL,26,@kD@\Ok
