OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785525522
OL,3,CNI roadworks company fined E1.2m after
OL,4,Cfather and two children died in lough
OL,6,FThis afternoon at Letterkenny Circuit
OL,7,FCriminal Court, Whitemountain Quarries
OL,8,Fwas fined a total of #1.2 million
OL,9,Feuros for its road management failure
OL,10,Fand exposing road users to risk.
OL,12,FThe judge described it as a most
OL,13,Ftragic case involving a family of
OL,14,Ffour, one of whom survived.
OL,16,FHe said 'the court could only attempt
OL,17,Fa shadow of an understanding of the
OL,18,Fpain and grief suffered by Geraldine
OL,19,FMullan.'
OL,26,@kD@\Ok
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/6
