OL,3,CNI roadworks company fined E1.2m after
OL,4,Cfather and two children died in lough
OL,6,FOutside court Geraldine Mullan read a
OL,7,Fstatement after the case ended.
OL,9,FShe said: "I lost my beloved husband
OL,10,FJohn, my precious son Tomas, and my
OL,11,Fbeautiful daughter Amelia. They were
OL,12,Fmy whole world, and I was the sole
OL,13,Fsurvivor of the accident that took
OL,14,Ftheir lives.
OL,16,F"All I have ever wanted is justice for
OL,17,FJohn, Tomas, and Amelia. Today's
OL,18,Fjudgment has lifted a weight from me.
OL,26,@kD@\OkrD@ZrpyD@Jrp
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785525522
OL,3,CNI roadworks company fined E1.2m after
OL,4,Cfather and two children died in lough
OL,6,F"They lost their voices on the night
OL,7,Fof our accident, so it was my
OL,8,Fprivilege and my responsibility to
OL,9,Fspeak for all four of us in court.
OL,11,F"Giving my victim impact statement
OL,12,Flast Friday was one of the hardest
OL,13,Fthings I've ever done, but I hope I
OL,14,Fdid them proud. No family should ever
OL,15,Fhave to endure the heartbreak that I
OL,16,Flive with every day.
OL,18,F"My grief will never end, but I made a
OL,19,Fpromise to John, Tomas, and Amelia on
OL,20,Fthe day I laid them to rest that I
OL,21,Fwould never lose hope.
OL,26,@kD@\Ok{D@Urp
