OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785525522
OL,3,CNI roadworks company fined E1.2m after
OL,4,Cfather and two children died in lough
OL,6,F"I promised I would keep living life
OL,7,Fto the fullest, cherish every moment,
OL,8,Fand honor their memory in everything I
OL,9,Fdo. I intend to keep that promise."
OL,11,FLast week, the CEO of the firm issued
OL,12,Fan apology to Geraldine Mullan and the
OL,13,Fcourt heard that its road safety
OL,14,Fmanagement has now been updated.
